		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>VRP/Musyk travel plan code. The travel plan is the parent of an @ComRes booking made through this interface.
           It's only necessary to send the SPNR code once when making the booking. The SPNR code is not an identifying part of the booking primary key.</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="Third_Party_CCFee" type="COM:Prc">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Third Party CC Fee (Cost) </xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
